  "body": "Consider this testcase:\r\nhttps://codepen.io/jasonwilliams1/pen/XBbZjL\r\n\r\n1. Load this testcase\r\n2. Focus on the textbox\r\n3. Press shift-tab to move focus into the radio button group\r\n4. Press spacebar to check the radio button\r\n5. Press spacebar to redundantly check the radio button\r\n6. observe no additional click event in the console\r\n\r\n**Repeating Click events**\r\nFirefox Developer Edition 62.0b6 (64-bit)\r\nMicrosoft Edge 42.17134.1.0\r\nInternet Explorer 11.165 Windows 10\r\n\r\n**Only 1 event**\r\nChrome Version 67.0.3396.99 (Official Build) (64-bit)\r\nOpera Version 57.0.3098.76 (64-bit)\r\nSafari Version 11.1 (11605.1.33.1.3)\r\n\r\nThe specification doesn't seem to cover what's supposed to happen in this instance.\r\nhttps://w3c.github.io/uievents/#event-type-click\r\n\r\n**Tracking Issues**\r\nBlink: https://bugs.chromium.org/p/chromium/issues/detail?id=863048\r\nWebkit: https://bugs.webkit.org/show_bug.cgi?id=187606\r\n\r\n**Arises From**\r\nhttps://github.com/facebook/react/issues/4854#issuecomment-404543424",
